arke: Carpentry & Construction 85% +2% as the catalog''s Carpentry row; Play Musical Instrument: Stringed 85% as Play Musical Instrument at 85 per_level 0 (no stringed row). Architecture and Civil Engineering are marked New! by the book and have no catalog rows; they are in the Ingenieure special ability with their printed 85% +2% and their own 30% +5% base, not stubbed. Schnellig: Dance at 90%. The Prowl 60%/85% is stealth, a special ability rather than the skill. The +10% to Technical and Science skills and to delicate-touch skills is conditional prose. || SCHNELLIG CHOICE: Jumpers or Tunnelers is a choose-one the format cannot put on a variant; it is one special ability describing both. || EQUIPMENT and MONEY: as per O.C.C. The Spinne Force Fields (Light 40 M.D.C., Medium 80, Heavy 160, Super-Heavy 250 M.D.C., belt or web-gear mounted, powered by a rechargeable cell or E-Clips) are described but given to no character and have no catalog rows; they are in GM Notes, not stubbed. || NOT STORED: size, weight, life span 4D6+62, reproduction, slave market value, habitat, allies and enemies are in GM Notes."
